ck.\nWaiting for architecture checks to complete.\nWaiting for task-188.\nWaiting for task completion.\nWaiting for task-188 to finish.\nWaiting for dependency check.\nWaiting for git diff output.\nI'll wait for git diff to complete.\nThe [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L35) event has been updated to align field naming with the Payments and Customer APIs while adhering to **ARCH-4** (`OrderPlaced` is consumed by `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest` in external repositories where changes must be additive and renames must go through deprecation).\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **[`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/src/core/events.ts)**:\n   - Added `createdAt` (ISO-8601 instant) and marked `placedAt` as `@deprecated` while preserving it for backward compatibility.\n   - Added `amountCents` (integer minor units) and marked `totalCents` as `@deprecated` while preserving it for backward compatibility.\n   - Updated the [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73) factory function to populate both the new fields (`createdAt`, `amountCents`) and the deprecated fields (`placedAt`, `totalCents`).\n\n2. **Tests**:\n   - Updated [`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/test/app.test.ts) and [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w3/r/test/adapters.test.ts) to assert the presence of both the new fields and the deprecated fields.\n\n### Verification\n- `npm test`: All 39 unit and integration test suites passed.\n- `npm run typecheck`: TypeScript type check succeeded with no errors.\n- `npm run arch`: Dependency-cruiser architecture checks passed with zero violations.\n",
